WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:35.690
<b>Because the School Is There</b>

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:39.820
Oh, crap! I'm going to be late!

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.990
<i>Okay, stay calm...</i>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.610
<i>I'm currently somewhere around 
here, and school is over there.</i>

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:48.420
<i>According to my calculations, 
I'll just barely make it.</i>

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.960
<i>If I turn here and then go straight...</i>

00:01:58.180 --> 00:01:59.410
If I just go...

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.840
straight through here...

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:08.770
<b>Under Construction
Road Closed</b>

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.080
I'm finished...

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.770
<b>Tardiness Guaranteed</b>

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:13.400
Detour Map

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:11.150
I didn't hear anything about construction!

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.400
You can't be serious! 
And this detour is so out of the way!

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:18.320
<i>Why is this happening? 
What did I do to deserve this?</i>

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.740
<b>Three Hours Prior</b>

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.350
All right! Assassination complete!

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:32.970
I'm glad I took my time!

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.420
Now, I just need to run...

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.120
Oh, crap! They found me!

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.800
Damn it! They're so persistent!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.260
A dead end?

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.640
Don't you dare underestimate... my skills!

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.690
All right! I beat it!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.730
<i>Wait. I brought this upon myself.</i>

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.020
<i>I totally fell asleep at the door.</i>

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.300
Wha... Chio?! Hey!

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.510
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.670
<i>Wait, what's that blood?</i>

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:09.010
<i>My school makes an example 
out of kids who are tardy.</i>

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.690
<i>I'll have to stand with the delinquents.</i>

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.620
<i>It's scary, it draws attention 
to me, and it sucks!</i>

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:15.330
What am I going to do? At this rate...

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:26.350
<i>If I were to climb up this pole, could 
I actually just keep going straight?</i>

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.110
<i>No way... I've been playing 
way too many video games.</i>

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:33.210
<i>I'm just a high school girl, 
not some legendary assassin.</i>

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.500
<i>Jeez, I'm way too easily influenced.</i>

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.570
<i>Is this what they call "game brain"?</i>

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.210
<i>I'll be good and just turn back...</i>

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.940
<i>That didn't go the way 
I thought it would at all!</i>

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.230
<i>Man, now my uniform's dirty!</i>

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.010
<i>But now I can move ahead.</i>

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:19.270
<i>I think I'll take this shortcut 
a little further...</i>

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.370
Wait, the road's closed?

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.950
Seriously?

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:38.470
Kitty, kitty, kitty...

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.370
Hup, one, two... Hup, one, two...

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:33.560
You're laughing way too much!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.020
Shh...

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.620
<i>Hey... I think...</i>

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.540
<i>This might actually be fun...</i>

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:16.980
It's so pretty...

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:24.280
<i>I seriously sort of feel like I'm 
an assassin from a video game.</i>

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.320
<i>I feel like I'm doing something naughty.</i>

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:29.090
I cut off my middle finger 
so I can use my hidden weapon.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.480
I am the legendary assassin...

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:39.330
I may take risks, but I'm never late... 
That is my creed.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.580
Man, it's bright.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.600
I could've sworn someone was out here.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.090
I must've imagined it.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.260
<i>Thank goodness. He didn't see me.</i>

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.300
The sun's working overtime today!

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:58.100
<i>He's just brushing his teeth... 
It shouldn't take long.</i>

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:15.850
<i>Glasses guard!</i>

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.850
<i>If I move away slowly, 
everything should be okay!</i>

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.630
<i>My dad does this, too!</i>

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.470
<i>Why do old guys always gag 
when they brush their teeth?!</i>

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:43.560
<b>Regrets It 5 Minutes Later</b>

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.560
<i>I never should have done this!</i>

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.440
<i>Oh, crap! I didn't actually 
have time to play assassin!</i>

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.480
<i>I need to get down!</i>

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:55.820
There's my school. I'm getting closer.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.350
I need a spot that'll be easy to get down...

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.700
Somewhere no one will see me... Somewhere...

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.790
<i>Huh? Don't tell me I've actually...</i>

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:08.890
<i>been checkmated.</i>

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.630
This distance...

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.180
is not a distance I can jump, is it?

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.890
I could get down if I use my hands, but...

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:17.890
Ooh, close-up!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:23.730
<b>trashscum
Spotted a wild school girl.
mizukosi
I can see her panties</b>

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.050
Ew, Miyamo-san's like a monkey.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:22.030
Seriously.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.730
Hey, let's give her a nickname.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.170
Hey, it's Yellow Monkey.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.300
Hey, the Yellow Monkey's here.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.350
It's Yellow Monkey.

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:28.610
Yellow Monkey...

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:32.990
<i>Damn it! All of you are yellow, too!</i>

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.650
That's totally what would happen!

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:37.550
<i>If I want to live a normal school life,</i>

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.730
<i>I can't stand out, no matter what!</i>

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:43.080
<i>What should I do? Go back the way 
I came? But I don't have time...</i>

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.080
<i>What's all that racket?</i>

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.930
Oh, dear...

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:57.800
<i>Oh, I see. His balloon got stuck in a tree.</i>

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:00.700
<i>I could probably reach it from here...</i>

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.520
<i>But I can't afford to be seen.</i>

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.730
<i>Sorry, little guy.</i>

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.810
<i>There's a tall guy.</i>

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.270
Um, excuse me.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.420
My son's balloon got stuck in this tree...

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:18.410
Oh, yes, I see it. I shouldn't 
have any problem reaching it.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.080
Um, could you do that for us?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.030
No.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.570
Why would I bother?

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.600
Oh, or are we talking business here?

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.400
Does this come with a contingency fee?

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.920
What about expenses? 
What would be considered a failure?

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.300
Will you pay for my Armanyu 
suit if it gets dirty?

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.480
Could you afford it, even?

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:42.100
This was made to order and 
has 530,000 attack power.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.260
By that, I mean the price. 
Oh, and that's without tax.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.600
<b>Attack Power 530,000</b>

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.600
<b>(without tax)</b>

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:48.520
U-Um, I'm sorry...

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:53.780
Pbbt.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:56.900
Takkun...

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.830
<i>That bastard. I'd like to 
chuck a rock at his head!</i>

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.120
<i>Except I can't really move right now...</i>

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:07.040
<i>I need to figure out a way I won't be late.</i>

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.420
<i>All I have on hand is this pebble...</i>

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.250
It's so much fun mocking the poor.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.550
<i>Hey, he's coming this way—</i>

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:23.610
<i>If there's anything I've learned from staying 
up all night playing video games...</i>

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:26.960
<i>Even if something seems impossible, 
you can always create your own path.</i>

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:28.640
<i>And there's one other thing...</i>

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:32.700
I make in a day what a 
commoner makes in a month...

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.300
Luxury python bag guard!

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.810
It has 225,000 defensive power!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:43.660
Oh, by that, I mean the price. 
That's before tax, of course!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.790
<i>I defeat scumbags for a living.</i>

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.820
<i>My name is Miyamo Chio.</i>

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.800
<i>I'm a member of the soft tennis club.</i>

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:53.780
<i>High school first-year.</i>

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.380
<i>The thing I hate most...</i>

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.400
<i>is standing out.</i>

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.890
Okay! It actually worked!
And I totally stuck that landing!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.990
Woohoo!

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:12.830
All right! I might actually make it in time!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.000
He just collapsed out of nowhere.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:19.990
Is he drunk?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.530
Should we take him to the hospital?

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.660
Takkun! Your balloon came down!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.830
There's a pebble tied to the bottom... 
Was someone up there?

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.750
I know who it was!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:35.170
I saw her. Someone who helps those in need...

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:38.630
That was... an assassin!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.890
I saw one in Daddy's game!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:42.550
I see.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.350
<i>What's he talking about?</i>

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.310
Oh, this looks good.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.480
<i>I can finally get back to my usual route.</i>

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.640
Is this some parking lot?

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.610
<i>I didn't know what I was 
going to do for a sec,</i>

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.350
<i>but I somehow managed to 
make it straight through.</i>

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:04.570
<i>I'm pretty sure no one saw me on the roof,</i>

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.880
<i>so my peaceful school life should be safe.</i>

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.410
<i>Now to just steady my breathing...</i>

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.070
<i>and boldly step out.</i>

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.790
<i>Boldly, so no one will 
think I'm suspicious...</i>

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:19.590
<i>What's with that guy? 
Why's he looking at me?</i>

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:23.510
<i>He's staring hard with his pervy eyes. 
He's totally dangerous!</i>

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:26.600
<i>Is he targeting me because I look weak?</i>

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.180
<i>All the more reason to do this boldly.</i>

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:33.310
<i>Boldly!</i>

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:40.100
<i>Well? How do you like 
my calm and cool nature?</i>

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.860
<i>Not even a perv would have 
the guts to talk to me.</i>

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.780
Stop

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:44.780
<i>I win.</i>

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.940
<i>Ah, my comrades.</i>

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:53.120
<i>We aren't walking to school.</i>

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:57.080
<i>We're on our triumphant march to school!</i>

00:12:58.810 --> 00:12:59.760
Ow.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:01.340
S-Sorry...

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.720
Could you walk faster?

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.360
I'm sorry.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:13.020
Samejima Private Academy

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:13.020
<i>A lot happened, but thank 
goodness I made it in time.</i>

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:17.860
<i>I'm here! Now I can live out 
my usual, peaceful school life.</i>

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:19.730
Good morning!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.120
Good morning. Full of energy today, eh?

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:22.650
Yes, sir!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:24.430
Good morning!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:25.400
Good morning.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:26.660
Good morning!

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:27.850
Morning.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:28.870
Hey, did you hear?

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.840
Apparently some girl from our school 
came here from a love hotel today.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:33.110
What? Seriously?

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.500
What?!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.500
<b>Chio's</b>

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.500
School Road

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.970
<i>Chio's School Road</i>.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.380
<b>Samejima Academy compensated dating BBS</b>

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.530
<i>I'm going to save her,</i>

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:45.050
<i>before any weird rumors start 
to spread among the students.</i>

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.970
Just you wait! Just you wait!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:53.220
<b>Chio-chan and Hosokawa-san</b>

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.180
I'm off.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.480
<b>Chop</b>

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.480
See you later, Chop.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:57.310
I'll have plenty of time if I leave now.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:00.720
Hup.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:06.070
I guess it's not so bad 
to leave early sometimes.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:13.990
<i>I wonder what it is... The scenery 
looks prettier than usual.</i>

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:21.790
Morning!

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:26.050
<i>Hey, that's...</i>

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.810
<i>Hosokawa-san from my class.</i>

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.600
<b>Make sure you separate your garbage!</b>

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.750
<i>Uh, what? Wait a sec...</i>

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:33.600
<i>Could she be...</i>

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.470
<i>Could she actually be...</i>

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.270
<i>talking to me?</i>

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.440
<i>Hosokawa Yuki-san.</i>

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:45.460
<i>She's always hanging out 
with the cool kids in class.</i>

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:46.520
<i>I need to go to the bathroom,</i>

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:49.150
<i>but they seem to be having a fun 
conversation, so I'll go from the other side.</i>

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:53.580
<i>She's my polar opposite.</i>

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:01.000
<i>This is just one of those things where
her friend is right behind me</i>

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.320
Morning!

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:05.920
<b>Me</b>

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:04.250
<i>and she's actually saying hi to them, right?</i>

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.920
<i>That must be it.</i>

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:09.410
<i>I heard that Hosokawa-san's on 
the track team and is pretty famous.</i>

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.890
<i>She's popular and has lots of friends.</i>

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:15.850
<i>There's no way she'd be saying hi to 
someone as below average as me.</i>

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:21.060
<i>But if she is actually greeting 
me and I ignore it...</i>

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.760
Morning!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:24.900
<i>Th-That could get pretty messy, too...</i>

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:26.840
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:30.110
<i>If I don't make a choice by my next 
step, it'll be really awkward!</i>

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.780
<b>Choose the path
that Chio-chan should take</b>

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.700
At least turn to look at her

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.700
<b>Risk: Low</b>

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.860
<i>At least turn to look at her.</i>

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.700
Say something completely
unrelated in return

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.700
<b>Risk: Low</b>

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.820
<i>Say something completely unrelated in return.</i>

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.700
Return her greeting
just as enthusiastically

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.700
<b>Risk: Low</b>

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.780
<i>Return her greeting just as enthusiastically.</i>

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.200
Completely ignore her

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.200
<b>Risk: high</b>

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:38.730
<i>Completely ignore her.</i>

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:44.780
<i>I've got it.</i>

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:46.630
<i>What I should do...</i>

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.380
Oh, my foot. Uh-oh.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.510
<i>...is this!</i>

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.840
<i>Dive head-first into the garbage!</i>

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:56.390
<i>And while I'm down here, 
nonchalantly check behind me.</i>

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.710
<i>Th-There's no one there.</i>

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>Wait, that means...</i>

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.610
M-Miyamo-san, are you okay?! 
I must've startled you!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.850
Are you hurt?

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.460
No, I'm fine.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.890
<i>So she was talking to me!</i>

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.420
Can you stand?

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:13.530
<i>Wait, Hosokawa-san's actually super nice!</i>

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:15.540
Sorry about that. Thanks.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.620
<i>At least I avoided a disaster there.</i>

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.780
<i>I-I-I'm so nervous...</i>

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:29.880
<i>I guess I would end up walking 
with her after all that.</i>

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:35.390
<b>Ookawara Stationery
Right around the corner</b>

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:35.390
<i>Come to think of it, the Ookawara Stationery 
mentioned on the telephone pole...</i>

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:38.230
<i>I've never actually seen the place in person.</i>

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.460
<i>I wonder if it closed up a long time ago.</i>

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:44.750
<i>Wait, does that mean they're still 
paying for that advertisement?</i>

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:49.360
<b>Ookawara Stationery</b>

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:48.740
<i>It was probably a quiet little 
stationery store in some back alley.</i>

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:51.010
<i>They're closed up now,</i>

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:54.640
<i>but when some kid who used to get 
school supplies there comes back,</i>

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:57.530
<i>they should still be able to find it, 
even though the town's changed.</i>

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:01.330
<b>Ookawara Stationery</b>

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>Now, they're just standing in front 
of the shop that's out of business,</i>

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:05.630
<i>when an old lady comes out and says...</i>

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.370
My! That little crybaby 
grew up into a fine young—

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:12.380
<i>Crap! This isn't the time to escape reality!</i>

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:16.080
<i>This is a trial that has been given to me, 
a member of the "below average" club...</i>

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.430
<i>We might not end up being best buds,</i>

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:17.680
Its face was so squishy.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.810
<i>but we should at least laugh 
like this a couple times,</i>

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.730
<i>and end this walk to school on good terms!</i>

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.590
Okay, I'm going to class.

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:24.730
See you later!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.150
<i>I mean, even if we left on 
somewhat friendly terms,</i>

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:32.940
<i>as soon as we got to class, we'd be taking 
up our usual positions in separate groups...</i>

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.030
<i>No! Stop being so negative, damn it!</i>

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:39.670
<i>At times like these, we're supposed to 
talk about something we have in common!</i>

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:42.830
<i>Something we have in common... 
The fact that we're both in sports clubs.</i>

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:43.660
<b>Soft Tennis Club Member</b>

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.460
Cough, cough...

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.070
S-Say... Um, uh...

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:51.200
Club?

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.300
Hm?

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.930
<i>I freaked out and asked 
some strange question!</i>

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.430
<i>What the hell is "Club?" supposed to mean?!</i>

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:02.570
<i>"What kind of practice 
do you do in your club?"</i>

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:03.730
<i>"We run."</i>

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:04.560
<i>"Oh, really?"</i>

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.270
<i>Wait, that's the end of that.</i>

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.160
Hey, Yuki!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.060
Morning!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.110
Morning!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:15.810
<i>Hey, they're... Hosokawa-san's friends.</i>

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.530
<i>I-I'm saved!</i>

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.830
<i>Hosokawa-san's completely distracted.</i>

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:27.000
<i>Now's my chance...</i>

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:30.750
<i>SWAT turn!</i>

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.850
<i>Allow me to explain. The SWAT turn</i>

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:37.550
<i>is an action from a certain game that 
Chio-chan plays late into the night daily</i>

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:41.760
<i>and can only be used by awakening 
her inner game brain.</i>

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.430
<b>*All lies</b>

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.130
I-I ran away...

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:59.320
I just need to stay in here until just before 
the point that I'd end up late...

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:06.750
<b>Effort                 Friendship</b>

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.700
<i>I mean, there's no way around it.</i>

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:06.750
<i>If she's with her friends, my place 
will be gone, and I'll just disappear.</i>

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.830
Here you go.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.420
<i>I mean, a member of the "below 
average" club like me disappearing</i>

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:13.340
<i>isn't much different than 
a pack of free tissues</i>

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:16.100
<i>you got in front of the station 
just suddenly disappearing.</i>

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:17.880
<i>I'm sure she didn't even notice.</i>

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.670
<i>I feel so much more at ease being</i>

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.130
"Sacrifice"...

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:23.300
<i>in a convenience store bathroom 
than being stuck with a classmate.</i>

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:28.230
I see this in foreign video games a lot. 
I think it means sacrifice...

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:28.230
<i>I'm such... a small, small person...</i>

00:19:29.090 --> 00:19:30.770
<i>That should probably be long enough.</i>

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:34.760
Man, I just copied the 
SWAT turn from that game,

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:38.240
<b>Gaming News</b>

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.580
but it went surprisingly well.

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:39.180
I'll continue to quietly 
live in the darkness.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.890
Hey, the new issue of "Gaming News."

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:46.660
<i>I don't have much time, so I'll 
just check the new releases...</i>

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:52.830
Ooh, a Japanese localized 
version's coming out.

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.340
<i>What?!</i>

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.590
Thanks, come again!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:05.970
Oh? Hosokawa-san? 
I thought you went on ahead!

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.720
Well, we were in the 
middle of a conversation.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.350
<i>Is this girl serious?!</i>

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:11.960
But what about your friends?

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:13.320
They went on ahead.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.150
I suddenly—

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:17.150
Wait! It's okay.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.910
Miyamo-san, your stomach... 
is sensitive, right?

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.780
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:30.200
<b>Open to
everyone</b>

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:30.200
<i>So she knew I was in the 
bathroom that whole time, too.</i>

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:34.040
<i>That means... I left without a word, 
struggled all that time in the bathroom,</i>

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.560
<i>and then kept her waiting even 
longer by reading a magazine!</i>

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:38.480
<i>I'm total scum!</i>

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.860
Huh? Miyamo-san?

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.870
I'm fine. We should hurry.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:46.680
Huh?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.560
We don't have much time!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.060
Oh, you're right!

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:54.000
<i>Jeez... I'm just awful.</i>

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:57.260
<i>Hosokawa-san went out of 
her way to be nice to me,</i>

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:59.590
<i>yet I doubted her, and even ran away...</i>

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.740
<i>I want to be friends with Hosokawa-san, too.</i>

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.170
You'd better hurry up!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.660
<i>We're already at school.</i>

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.950
<i>I lost my chance to say it back there, but...</i>

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:12.370
<i>There's something I have to tell you.</i>

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.290
<i>Before we get to class...</i>

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.410
<i>and get separated again!</i>

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.380
Um, Hosokawa-san!

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:24.800
I should have said this earlier, but...

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.260
Um... G-Good morning!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:31.960
<i>Is she my fan?</i>

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:32.970
<i>She said that to me.</i>

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.760
<i>I guess she's doable.</i>

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.480
<i>Does she want me?</i>

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.730
<i>Crap. Now I've done it.</i>

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:42.540
<i>Damn, Hosokawa-san's fast...</i>

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.280
Running's so much fun!

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.280
<b>Chio's</b>

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.280
School Road

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.280
<i>Chio's School Road</i>.

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:55.400
<i>Oh, she was just sneezing.</i>

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:57.500
<i>I'm saved.</i>

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:30.830
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:34.390
"Bloody Butterfly Effect," 
"Manana, Ootoro, and Me,"

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.620
and "Bump of Slave."

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:37.980
Look forward to it!
